WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.100
Haddad will create the Hora Certa Network: 31 health centers equipped for appointments,

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:15.500
specialized tests and minor surgeries - all in one place, all by appointment.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.900
That frees up hospitals to care only for emergencies

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:22.900
and surgeries that require admission.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:25.400
Think new. Think Haddad 13.
